      "preview": "בְּכִי: substantivo masculino: choro; luto, contrição e uso figurado.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Judges 21:2\" href=\"/Judges.21.2\">Jz 21.2</a></sup> <strong>choro</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:2\" href=\"/Judges.21.2\">Jz 21.2</a> + 20 vezes (também construto <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.8\">Dt 34.8</a>, etc.); <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּבְכִ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:2\" href=\"/Genesis.45.2\">Gn 45.2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּ֑כִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.2\">Is 15.2</a> + 6 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכְי֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:9\" href=\"/Psalms.6.9\">Sl 6.9</a>;—<em>choro</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:6\" href=\"/Psalms.30.6\">Sl 30.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.2\">Is 15.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15.5</a>; como acusativo cognato (com <span dir=\"rtl\">בכה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:2\" href=\"/Judges.21.2\">Jz 21.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.36\">2Sm 13.36</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.3\">2Rs 20.3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.3\">Is 38.3</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.9\">Is 16.9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בבכי)</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.32\">Jr 48.32</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מבכי)</span>; audível <span dir=\"rtl\">קול ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:9\" href=\"/Psalms.6.9\">Sl 6.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.19\">Is 65.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:13\" href=\"/Ezra.3.13\">Ed 3.13</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.21\">Jr 3.21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.16\">Jr 31.16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.3\">Is 15.3</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ייליל יֹרֵד בבכי</span> ver <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.17\">Jr 9.17</a>); assim também <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:2\" href=\"/Genesis.45.2\">Gn 45.2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ויתן את־קלו בב׳)</span> e <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.5\">Jr 48.5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בבכי יעלה בכי</span> isto é, o seu som subirá)—mas aqui o texto é suspeito, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15.5</a>; como causa de desfiguração <a data-ref=\"Job 16:16\" href=\"/Job.16.16\">Jó 16.16</a>; ‖ palavras de luto <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:3\" href=\"/Esther.4.3\">Et 4.3</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אֵבֶל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפֵּד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.9\">Jr 31.9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">תחנונים</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.21\">Jr 3.21</a>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.10\">Jr 9.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.15\">Jr 31.15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(נהי)</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אבל\" href=\"/BDB,_אבל\", dir=\"rtl\">בכי אבל משׁה</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.8\">Dt 34.8</a> e Di <em>ad loc.;</em> contrição (humilhação) <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:12\" href=\"/Joel.2.12\">Jl 2.12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">צום</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפֵּד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.12\">Is 22.12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מספד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קרחה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חגור שׂק</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:13\" href=\"/Malachi.2.13\">Ml 2.13</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אנקה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דמעה</span>); de choro amargo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.4\">Is 22.4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמָרֵר בַּבֶּ֑כִי</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.15\">Jr 31.15</a> (e <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.7\">Is 33.7</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">בכי יעזר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.9\">Is 16.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.32\">Jr 48.32</a> isto é, Yaʿzer em Moabe, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יעזר</span> nome próprio; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:10\" href=\"/Psalms.102.10\">Sl 102.10</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁקוי בב׳ מסכתי</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:4\" href=\"/Psalms.42.4\">Sl 42.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:6\" href=\"/Psalms.80.6\">Sl 80.6</a> e babilônico <em>dîmtu maštîtî</em>, <em>lágrimas</em> (<em>eram</em>) <em>minha bebida</em> Zim<sup>BP 34, 42</sup>). Figuradamente, de correntes de água que gotejam <span dir=\"rtl\">(נהרות)</span> em minas—obstáculo aos mineiros <a data-ref=\"Job 28:11\" href=\"/Job.28.11\">Jó 28.11</a>.",
