      "preview": "בְּכוֹר: substantivo masculino: primogênito; pessoas, animais e usos figurados.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹר</span></big><sub>122</sub>  <strong>substantivo masculino: primogênito</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:23\" href=\"/Genesis.35.23\">Gn 35.23</a> + 78 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:13\" href=\"/Genesis.25.13\">Gn 25.13</a> + 14 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:3\" href=\"/Genesis.49.3\">Gn 49.3</a> + 14 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:6\" href=\"/Genesis.38.6\">Gn 38.6</a> + 3 vezes; plural construto <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.37\">Ne 10.37</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹרֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:10\" href=\"/Psalms.136.10\">Sl 136.10</a>; também <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכֹרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:4\" href=\"/Genesis.4.4\">Gn 4.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.37\">Ne 10.37</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכֹרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.6\">Dt 12.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.17\">Dt 12.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.23\">Dt 14.23</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>homens e mulheres:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>indivíduos</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:13\" href=\"/Genesis.25.13\">Gn 25.13</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:33\" href=\"/Genesis.43.33\">Gn 43.33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:18\" href=\"/Genesis.48.18\">Gn 48.18</a> (E) +. <strong>b.</strong>  coletivo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:46\" href=\"/Numbers.3.46\">Nm 3.46</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:50\" href=\"/Numbers.3.50\">Nm 3.50</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 8:16\" href=\"/Numbers.8.16\">Nm 8.16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:15\" href=\"/Numbers.18.15\">Nm 18.15</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  plural <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.37\">Ne 10.37</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 135:8\" href=\"/Psalms.135.8\">Sl 135.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:10\" href=\"/Psalms.136.10\">Sl 136.10</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">כל בכור</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:5\" href=\"/Exodus.11.5\">Êx 11.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:12\" href=\"/Exodus.12.12\">Êx 12.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:29\" href=\"/Exodus.12.29\">Êx 12.29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:2\" href=\"/Exodus.13.2\">Êx 13.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:13\" href=\"/Exodus.13.13\">Êx 13.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:15\" href=\"/Exodus.13.15\">Êx 13.15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:28\" href=\"/Exodus.22.28\">Êx 22.28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:2\" href=\"/Exodus.34.2\">Êx 34.2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:12\" href=\"/Numbers.3.12\">Nm 3.12</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:13\" href=\"/Numbers.3.13\">Nm 3.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:40\" href=\"/Numbers.3.40\">Nm 3.40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:42\" href=\"/Numbers.3.42\">Nm 3.42</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:43\" href=\"/Numbers.3.43\">Nm 3.43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:45\" href=\"/Numbers.3.45\">Nm 3.45</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 8:17\" href=\"/Numbers.8.17\">Nm 8.17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 8:18\" href=\"/Numbers.8.18\">Nm 8.18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:4\" href=\"/Numbers.33.4\">Nm 33.4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:51\" href=\"/Psalms.78.51\">Sl 78.51</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:36\" href=\"/Psalms.105.36\">Sl 105.36</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>animais:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>indivíduos</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.26\">Lv 27.26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:17\" href=\"/Numbers.18.17\">Nm 18.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.19\">Dt 15.19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.17\">Dt 33.17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  coletivo <span dir=\"rtl\">בכור בהמה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:5\" href=\"/Exodus.11.5\">Êx 11.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:29\" href=\"/Exodus.12.29\">Êx 12.29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:15\" href=\"/Exodus.13.15\">Êx 13.15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:41\" href=\"/Numbers.3.41\">Nm 3.41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:15\" href=\"/Numbers.18.15\">Nm 18.15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כל הבכור</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.19\">Dt 15.19</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בכרות</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:4\" href=\"/Genesis.4.4\">Gn 4.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.6\">Dt 12.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.17\">Dt 12.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.23\">Dt 14.23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.37\">Ne 10.37</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>figurado</em>, substantivo de relação <span dir=\"rtl\">בכור מות</span> <em>primogênito da morte</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:13\" href=\"/Job.18.13\">Jó 18.13</a> (doença mortal); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹרֵי דַלִּים</span> <em>primogênitos dos pobres</em> (os mais pobres) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.30\">Is 14.30</a>; Israel é o primogênito de Yahweh entre as nações <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:22\" href=\"/Exodus.4.22\">Êx 4.22</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.9\">Jr 31.9</a>; e a descendência de Davi entre as dinastias <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:28\" href=\"/Psalms.89.28\">Sl 89.28</a>.",
